# Build artefacts of docs/screenshots/capture.py.
#
# The PNGs the script writes ARE committed — the README links to them, and a
# README whose images are not in the repository is a README with broken images.
# The intermediate HTML is not: it is regenerated on every run, differs on every
# run, and is of no use to anyone reading the repository.
docs/screenshots/hero.html

